'''Chimchar''' (Japanese: '''ヒコザル''' ''Hikozaru'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

