==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|POP Series 6|Chimchar|14}} from the {{TCG|POP Series 6}} collection of cards.
**Both cards have the {{m|Scratch}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Chimchar}} can learn.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Storm|Chimchar|15}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Storm}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Chimchar}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shining Pearl}}.

